---
import Layout from '../components/layout/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Layout title="Investigación - Universidad Nacional del Santa">
	<div class="bg-background-alt py-16 md:py-24 border-b border-slate-200">
		<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
			<span class="text-accent font-semibold tracking-wider text-sm uppercase mb-4 block">Portal de Conocimiento</span>
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-serif font-bold text-surface mb-6 leading-tight">
				Avances que impulsan el <br class="hidden md:block" /> <span class="text-uns">desarrollo regional</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-surface-light max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10">
				Descubre las últimas publicaciones, proyectos financiados y patentes desarrolladas por los docentes e investigadores de la Universidad Nacional del Santa.
			</p>
			<div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4">
				<button class="bg-uns text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-md font-medium hover:bg-uns-light transition-colors shadow-sm">
					Explorar Investigaciones
				</button>
				<button class="bg-white text-surface border border-slate-300 px-6 py-3 rounded-md font-medium hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors shadow-sm">
					Directorio Docente
				</button>
			</div>
			
			<div class="mt-12 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-surface-light/70 text-sm">
				<span class="w-12 h-px bg-slate-200"></span>
				<p class="font-serif italic tracking-wide">Iniciativa propuesta por el Dr. Alfredo Daza Vergaray</p>
				<span class="w-12 h-px bg-slate-200"></span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
		<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-surface">Publicaciones Recientes</h2>
			<a href="#" class="text-uns font-medium text-sm hover:underline">Ver todas &rarr;</a>
		</div>
		
		<section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
			<!-- Tarjeta 1 -->
			<article class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group cursor-pointer">
				<div class="h-48 bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center border-b border-slate-100 overflow-hidden relative">
					<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-uns/5 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10 mix-blend-multiply"></div>
					<img src={`${base}/images/pub_biotec.webp`} alt="Biotecnología" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
				</div>
				<div class="p-6">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
						<span class="bg-accent/10 text-accent-dark text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded border border-accent/20">Biotecnología</span>
						<span class="text-surface-light text-xs font-medium">Mayo 2026</span>
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold mb-2 leading-tight group-hover:text-uns transition-colors">Nuevos métodos de extracción de compuestos bioactivos en algas locales</h3>
					<p class="text-surface-light text-sm mb-4 line-clamp-3">
						Un estudio liderado por la Facultad de Ciencias demuestra que el uso de tecnologías de ultrasonido mejora la eficiencia en la extracción...
					</p>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-auto">
						<img src={`${base}/images/inv_juan.webp`} alt="Dr. Juan Pérez" class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full object-cover border border-slate-200" />
						<span class="text-xs font-medium text-surface">Dr. Juan Pérez</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</article>

			<!-- Tarjeta 2 -->
			<article class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group cursor-pointer">
				<div class="h-48 bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center border-b border-slate-100 overflow-hidden relative">
					<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-uns/5 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10 mix-blend-multiply"></div>
					<img src={`${base}/images/pub_ingenieria.webp`} alt="Ingeniería" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
				</div>
				<div class="p-6">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
						<span class="bg-accent/10 text-accent-dark text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded border border-accent/20">Ingeniería</span>
						<span class="text-surface-light text-xs font-medium">Abril 2026</span>
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold mb-2 leading-tight group-hover:text-uns transition-colors">Optimización de redes eléctricas usando inteligencia artificial</h3>
					<p class="text-surface-light text-sm mb-4 line-clamp-3">
						El departamento de Ingeniería en Energía propone un algoritmo de machine learning capaz de predecir picos de demanda y redistribuir cargas...
					</p>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-auto">
						<img src={`${base}/images/inv_maria.webp`} alt="Dra. María Gonzales" class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full object-cover border border-slate-200" />
						<span class="text-xs font-medium text-surface">Dra. María Gonzales</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</article>

			<!-- Tarjeta 3 -->
			<article class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group cursor-pointer">
				<div class="h-48 bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center border-b border-slate-100 overflow-hidden relative">
					<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-uns/5 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10 mix-blend-multiply"></div>
					<img src={`${base}/images/pub_salud.webp`} alt="Salud Pública" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
				</div>
				<div class="p-6">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
						<span class="bg-accent/10 text-accent-dark text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded border border-accent/20">Salud Pública</span>
						<span class="text-surface-light text-xs font-medium">Marzo 2026</span>
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold mb-2 leading-tight group-hover:text-uns transition-colors">Impacto de la calidad del agua en zonas rurales costeras</h3>
					<p class="text-surface-light text-sm mb-4 line-clamp-3">
						Investigación multidisciplinaria analiza la correlación entre metales pesados en fuentes de agua subterráneas y enfermedades...
					</p>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-auto">
						<img src={`${base}/images/inv_carlos.webp`} alt="MSc. Carlos Vílchez" class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full object-cover border border-slate-200" />
						<span class="text-xs font-medium text-surface">MSc. Carlos Vílchez</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</article>
		</section>
	</div>
</Layout>
